OL,3,GNEWSAMan and dog die after fire breaks
OL,4,Aout in home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and a dog have died in a house
OL,7,Ffire on Merseyside.
OL,9,FEmergency crews were called to the
OL,10,Fsemi-detached home on Beaufort Drive in
OL,11,FWallasey, Wirral, just after 20:30 BST
OL,12,Fon Monday.
OL,14,FThe man was at first rescued from the
OL,15,Fbuilding but pronounced dead by
OL,16,Fparamedics before arriving at Arrowe
OL,17,FPark Hospital. The dog died at the
OL,18,Fscene.
OL,20,FPolice and the fire service have
OL,21,Fstarted a joint investigation into what
OL,22,Fcaused the fire.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
